<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woodside Sept qtr sales A$184.9 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woodside Sept qtr sales A$184.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodside Petroleum Ltd said on Wednesday sales revenue totalled A$184.9 million in the three months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Sales in the 1995 September quarter were A$151.4 million.  </p>
<p>Woodside, 40 percent owned by the Royal Dutch/Shell Group, said its capital expenditure was A$28.1 million for the September quarter and exploration expenditure was A$19.9 million in the quarter.</p>
<p>Woodside is the operator of the North West Shelf gas project offshore Western Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
